[
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:0.1"], "en": "Netti 2.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:0.2"], "en": "Uddesavāra:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:1.1"], "en": "Therein, what are the sixteen modes of conveying (hāras)?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:1.2"], "en": "Exposition, investigation, reasoning, proximate cause, characteristic, fourfold array, turning back, analysis, reversal, synonym, designation, entry, cleansing, resolution, equipment, and coordination—thus it is said.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:2.1"], "en": "Its summary verse is:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:3.1"], "en": "Exposition, investigation, reasoning...", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:3.2"], "en": "The footing, the characteristic,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:3.3"], "en": "the fourfold array, the turning back,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:3.4"], "en": "the analysis, and the reversal.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:4.1"], "en": "Synonyms, designation,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:4.2"], "en": "entry, purification;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:4.3"], "en": "foundation, requisites,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:4.4"], "en": "The sixteen [modes of] coordination.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:5.1", "PA_ne_2:5.2"], "en": "These sixteen modes of conveying (hāra) have been proclaimed according to their meaning as unmixed.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:5.3", "PA_ne_2:5.4"], "en": "\"And for these there is the analysis of the method in detail.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:6.1"], "en": "In that regard, what are the five methods?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:6.2"], "en": "The *Nandiyāvaṭṭa*, the *Tipukkhalo*, the *Sīhavikkīḷita*, the *Disālocana*, and the *Aṅkusa*.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:7.1"], "en": "Its subsequent verse:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:8.1"], "en": "First, the *Nandiyāvaṭṭa*.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:8.2"], "en": "And the second is Tipukkhalo;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:8.3", "PA_ne_2:8.4"], "en": "the third is named Sīhavikkīḷita, and Nayalañjaka.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:9.1", "PA_ne_2:9.2"], "en": "They say that \"Observing the Directions\" is the fourth supreme method;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:9.3"], "en": "the fifth is called \"The Hook.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:9.4"], "en": "\"All have gone by way of the five methods.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:10.1"], "en": "In that regard, what are the eighteen root-terms?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:10.2"], "en": "Nine terms are wholesome; nine terms are unwholesome.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:10.3_0"], "en": "In this regard, what are the nine unwholesome factors? They are craving, ignorance, greed, hatred, delusion, the perception of beauty, the perception of pleasure, the perception of permanence, and the perception of self.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:10.3_1", "PA_ne_2:10.3_2"], "en": "These are the nine unwholesome factors, wherein the entire category of the unwholesome is included and converges.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:11.1"], "en": "In this regard, what are the nine wholesome factors?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:11.2"], "en": "Serenity, insight, non-greed, non-hatred, non-delusion, the perception of foulness, the perception of suffering, the perception of impermanence, and the perception of non-self—these are the nine wholesome factors, wherein the entire category of the wholesome is included and converges.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:11.3"], "en": "Here is the summary verse:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:12.1"], "en": "Craving and ignorance as well,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:12.2"], "en": "greed, hatred, and likewise delusion;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:12.3"], "en": "and the four perversions—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:12.4"], "en": "The nine terms concerning the plane of defilements:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:13.1"], "en": "serenity, insight,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:13.2"], "en": "and the three roots that are wholesome.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:13.3"], "en": "The four foundations of mindfulness;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:13.4"], "en": "the nine terms of the sense-faculties stage.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:14.1"], "en": "Through these nine terms, they are wholesome.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:14.2"], "en": "And nine unwholesome factors are joined together;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:14.3"], "en": "these indeed are the root-terms,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:14.4"], "en": "which become eighteen terms.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ne_2:14.5"], "en": "The Section on Enumeration.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"}
]
